{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b576b266d01fe0a7b81600d8f3fb4030337f2a7a5c11643a55a6a4a5598299b4", "ja": "（今日は、首都圏でのツアー公演で使われる、\n新曲のPV撮影だ。琴葉の様子はどうだろう？）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄新歌的PV，用于首都圈巡演的演出。琴叶现在怎么样了呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "1692c868ec4f3746ac7ed9a114b49104effb69dd2c638bcf819b8e7a38390037", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。\nこの衣装、とってもかわいいです。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n这套服装非常可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1002_p", "source_sha256": "84a7139e43bdcbb04cc7057f0b3a5e5f63724ece9eb52d1c48b3ec909448677d", "ja": "ああ、よく似合ってるよ。\nどうだ？　公演に向けて、レッスンは順調か？", "zh": "啊，很适合你。\n怎么样？为了公演，练习还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "9667bdb619fd4cbd5e73cf39ddc5b0baeab9b66be5ad20916311b077aed22b82", "ja": "はい。首都エリアでの最初の公演なので、\n私たちも、かなり気合いが入ってます。", "zh": "是的。这是我们在首都地区的首场公演，所以大家都干劲十足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "78b1031aef109642bf7b96a1ddf5015a30e7c0668ef0e7fe8ed591faf91999d4", "ja": "ツアーの集大成、というのもありますけど、\n私たちひとりひとりの集大成でもありますから。", "zh": "虽然也是巡演的总结演出，但这同样是我们每个人的集大成。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c69758f644fd552027fed2e70766c11b15821b2dad357b3be20eb0ef3f112573", "ja": "そうだよな。これまでの集大成だ。\nアイドルとして培ってきた経験を、全て発揮してくれ！", "zh": "是啊。这是我们至今为止的集大成。\n把作为偶像积累下来的经验全部发挥出来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1006_017kth", "source_sha256": "6de3cc2f7dcf239f587656cae07a52493e514ad3d2de729c352af949bd9744b9", "ja": "はい、そのつもりです。\n全てを出し切って、挑みます！", "zh": "是的，我也是这么打算的。\n我会竭尽全力，迎接挑战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "0e93d3860b65e90bc0894a104cdc4e8bbc4e90dd2fe84d906c45befe5d99fbc0", "ja": "でも……なんだか、妙に感傷的になっちゃいますね。\nようやくここまで来たんだな、って。", "zh": "可是……不知怎么的，突然变得格外感伤呢。\n想着我们终于走到这一步了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "7132af7a8c298878ed6170a486dc9724e5f9ab5a21cb495792e0dc6d373f5dda", "ja": "オーディションを受けたあの日から、\n私のアイドル人生が始まって……。", "zh": "从参加试镜的那天起，\n我的偶像生涯就开始了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "036a650af88bcab0c031d2b95d47db4f7aa1e956ca87d82aa9c7898f6fd27e92", "ja": "はじめての公演に、はじめてのテレビ出演……。\n色々なお仕事をして、そして、ようやく武道館で……。", "zh": "第一次公演，第一次参加电视节目……  \n做过各种各样的工作，然后，终于在武道馆……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b455528067eb85de60600102b68f2fa43e7144d270a4402d16188ad0c47f73cb", "ja": "ああ。本当に、いろいろなことがあった。\nでも、ここまで来られたのは、琴葉の努力の成果だよ。", "zh": "啊，真的发生了很多事。\n不过，能走到今天这一步，都是琴叶努力的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "c42b41247bdb5bf6e3428bb60f6bb00d89f6445dad20a8a6dfdc85a3455cdc45", "ja": "いえ……私ひとりの力だけでは、ここまで\n来られませんでした。劇場のみんなはもちろん……。", "zh": "不……光凭我一个人的力量，是走不到\n这一步的。剧场的大家自不用说……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1012_017kth", "source_sha256": "3cc105d34ac371e72acf9c496f838cc5bcfa99572850537cb53e44d6f18508c3", "ja": "応援してくれた全国のファンのみなさん。そして……\n{$P$}がいてくれたからです。", "zh": "还有支持我的全国粉丝们。以及……\n是因为有{$P$}在身边。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a0d068c796d92590de0702cde2adbda4a99b9dfaf197c348f32c6335d478809e", "ja": "大したことはしてないよ。\nただ、少しだけ琴葉のサポートをしただけだ。", "zh": "我也没做什么大不了的事。\n只不过是稍微支持了琴叶一下而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "e966d8389049c8c82c88cfed464eb85d55fa2d9d27f132fe93f3ecb454a3300b", "ja": "そのサポートのおかげで、私はアイドルとして\nここまで成長できたと思ってます。でも……。", "zh": "多亏了那份支持，我才能作为偶像成长到今天。我是这么认为的。不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1015_017kth", "source_sha256": "3e034352a28f8caf2607c2c885497b20a2e3a1d59f9e46b2d180cc19530dcdf5", "ja": "私のアイドル人生は、まだまだこれからなので……。\nこれからも一緒に、この道を走ってもらえますか？", "zh": "我的偶像人生还只是刚刚开始……今后也能和我一起在这条路上奔跑吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_1016", "source_sha256": "d7dc2c584dab1c79c1051244bd1990da52c55f4f5fffd94bd0097c76a51bd1ca", "ja": "もちろん！", "zh": "那当然！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_2000_p", "source_sha256": "fe852375deef05faa41ff74a436e08dde91912623be828eaadf48bfae4164639", "ja": "ああ、もちろん！\n一緒に、どこまでも走り続けよう！", "zh": "啊，当然！\n一起一直跑下去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_2001_017kth", "source_sha256": "c073cbbb90dd9aebcf918fbbf7fb2bb772b415a10190e3b5f96b76799ee31389", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}……\nあっ、そ、そろそろ始まりますね！　行ってきます！", "zh": "好的！{$P$}……\n啊，那个、差不多要开始了！我先去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0353_2002_p", "source_sha256": "3620d369906dd91f0318fb454e94bea597c635c063e3832773525889c8c6bb66", "ja": "（さあ、新たなステージの幕開けだ。琴葉がどんな\n未来を切り開いていくか、しっかりと見届けよう！）", "zh": "（新舞台即将拉开帷幕。好好见证琴叶将开拓出怎样的未来吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
